+# Research
+- **Decision**: half-open intervals `[start,end)`. Rationale: end is the start of the day after the last day, so back-to-back rentals do not clash.
+- **Decision**: accept only ISO strings ending in `Z` (UTC). Alternative: accept offsets and convert; rejected as ambiguous for "midnight UTC".
+- **Decision**: sequential ids (`booking-N`). Alternative: UUID; unnecessary.
